# CMOS 4:1 Multiplexer Design using LTspice

## Project Overview

This project involves the transistor-level design of a 4:1 CMOS Multiplexer using LTspice as part of my InternPe VLSI Internship.

## Objectives

* Design a 4:1 CMOS Multiplexer using CMOS transistors.
* Understand PMOS and NMOS transistor operation.
* Implement input selection using two select lines.
* Analyze the circuit using LTspice.

## Working Principle

A 4:1 Multiplexer selects one of four data inputs based on two select lines.

| S1 | S0 | Selected Input |
| -- | -- | -------------- |
| 0  | 0  | D0             |
| 0  | 1  | D1             |
| 1  | 0  | D2             |
| 1  | 1  | D3             |

## Tools Used

* LTspice
* CMOS Technology
* PMOS and NMOS Transistors

